- awesome-skills/mermaid-syntax-skill (MIT) — several parser traps in
  references/layout-and-renderers.md
- agent-skills-hub/agent-skills-hub, skills/markdown-mermaid-writing (MIT,
  Clayton Young / Superior Byte Works) — group-to-group vs node-to-node guidance
